8958,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tiEUe","user":{"login":"dragonhunt02","id":190845674,"node_id":"U_kgDOC2AS6g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190845674?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonhunt02","html_url":"https://github.com/dragonhunt02","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonhunt02/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonhunt02/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonhunt02/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonhunt02/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonhunt02/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonhunt02/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonhunt02/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonhunt02/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonhunt02/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-27T07:05:34Z","updated_at":"2025-05-27T07:06:27Z","body":"@Faless Thanks for your review. I read your new PR and the purpose of `Node::get_node_rpc_config` seems clear now in documentation.\r\n\r\nFrom a Node, this gets functions with @rpc annotation\r\n```\r\nget_script().get_rpc_config()\r\n```\r\nthis gets RPCs set with rpc_config()\r\n```\r\nget_node_rpc_config()\r\n```\r\nI think a utility method to get available rpcs of both Node and its Script could be useful still.\r\nI may consider opening a different PR as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement in future.\r\n\r\nThank you again.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2911388958/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]